	"Description": "Our friend Clint now sells the missing ingredients and items in his store.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />He's waiting for you to show you the things he just built.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />And the other new things that just came to him at the store\n<br />\n<br />Enter the store and see what's new yourself\n<br />Scroll down until you find it.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />I made some modifications to the Mod to fulfill some requests \n<br />I put the new items separated by category \n<br />So if you don't want some part of the Mod just delete the folder containing what you don't need\u00A0 \n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b]-&gt; Installation &lt;-[/b]\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />1- Download the desired mod directly from the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley]Nexus Mods[/url] [b]This is the only site where I put my Mods [/b]\n<br />2- Move the zip file to your Stardew Valley's Mods folder\n<br />3- Extract the files in the Mods folder\u00A0\n<br />4- Run the game with the SMAPI launcher\u00A0\n<br />5- Be happy\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />[b]\n<br />\n<br />-&gt; Uninstall &lt;-[/b]\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />1- Delete the folder containing the Mod files that is located in your Stardew Valley's Mods folder\u00A0\n<br />2- Go back on the\u00A0 [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley]Nexus Mods[/url] and leave a comment saying why you uninstalled the mod [s](Optional)[/s]\n<br />3- Too bad you don't want me anymore, but I'll get over it\u00A0\n<br />4- Go ahead and have fun in Stardew Valley without me\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />[b]\n<br />\n<br />-&gt; Update &lt;-[/b]\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />1- Delete the folder containing the Mod files that is located in your Stardew Valley's Mods folder\u00A0\n<br />2- Proceed with the installation of the update normally, follow from step 2 of the installation\u00A0\n<br />[b]\n<br />*Update note [/b]\n<br />[i]Do not replace or overwrite the files in the folder, this may cause errors\n<br />Delete first, and only then extract the new files from the update in the mods folder [/i]\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Feel free to comment and suggest improvements.\u00A0\n<br />[b]\n<br />Don't forget to endorse the mods you like.\u00A0\n<br />This is the easiest and cheapest way to help a modder.\u00A0\n<br />It won't cost you nothing, and will help me a lot! [/b]\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />For more of my mods [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/users/49910956?tab=user+files]Click here[/url]\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />If you want to help more, below there are some links.\u00A0\n<br />Consider making a small donation.\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://www.paypal.me/BrunBsa]PayPal[/url] &lt;-&gt; [url=https://picpay.me/brunosantosaraujo]PicPay[/url] &lt;-&gt; [url=https://pag.ae/7XDsK4iQs]PagSeguro[/url]\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />My social networks are in the link below, Come talk to me.\u00A0 [url=https://linktr.ee/BrunoSAraujo]LoganDoidao[/url]",
